    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists won't do anything. they'll just see what the internet sees. there's no fixing it when the damage is this permanent. people don't forgive, they just move on to the next thing they can hate. it's like i'm trapped in this shell of a person that nobody wants and i can't even stand myself.",
