    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about being alone though. it's the fact that everything i worked for and everything i believed in is just... gone. there's no coming back from this. even if i tried to stay, i'm just walking around a corpse. the person i was is already gone. it feels like there's nothing left to even occupy this space.",
